WEBVTT

00:18:27.996 --> 00:18:30.716
It's good news that there's really
a pretty clear road map

00:18:30.756 --> 00:18:33.516
on how to do this and how to make
people feel welcome

00:18:33.556 --> 00:18:36.036
and how to have everyone
again, be better off.

00:18:36.716 --> 00:18:39.716
